#### "async۾8چ210ڑےیسےیہ primary/default mode. It makes use of `async`/`await` and [`util.promisify`](https://nodejs.org/api/util.html#util_util_promisify_original).

#### "sync۾6چ183ڑے/syncسے/syncہ opt-in mode, ideal for scenarios where `async` usage cannot be supported.


